// Deep-merged into data/characters/player_cat.gon for the Joker's Luck combat test: the player cats carry the
// native JokersLuck status from the first turn (StatusOnBattleStart, the same passive the base items use), so
// `expect stacks JokersLuck on 0 varied` can observe the reroll each turn. Test-only; never ship or play with it.
PlayerCat {
	passives {
		StatusOnBattleStart {
			JokersLuck 1
		}
	}
}
